WEBVTT

00:04:29.204 --> 00:04:33.704
for society than making people feel
better about their situation.

00:04:34.163 --> 00:04:38.329
Yeah, I mean, I think it certainly tracks
with how I think about, in general,

00:04:38.329 --> 00:04:40.538
bad being stronger than good and

00:04:40.538 --> 00:04:43.246
the alleviation of misery
contributing more to

00:04:43.246 --> 00:04:45.579
the quality of people's
lives than, you know,

00:04:45.579 --> 00:04:48.871
some degree of elevating of of the
amount of joy that they feel.

00:04:49.579 --> 00:04:52.621
But I also wonder at times if this
is not a false dichotomy,

00:04:52.871 --> 00:04:54.829
that if you want to make people happy,

00:04:55.121 --> 00:04:59.079
it's awfully difficult to do that if you
don't pay attention to the misery

00:04:59.079 --> 00:05:01.121
or suffering that they might experience.
Well.